WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.387
Here's the manifest.

2
00:00:01.387 --> 00:00:03.762
Ten tabs, one per daily check.

3
00:00:03.762 --> 00:00:08.973
Eight read tables: telemetry
completeness, the synchronization probe,

4
00:00:08.973 --> 00:00:12.682
risky users and sign-ins,
emergency access sign-ins,

5
00:00:12.682 --> 00:00:17.451
noncompliant devices, grants, D L
P alerts, and the log review queue.

6
00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:22.768
Two are link-outs: Entra Health, because
its alerts aren't in Log Analytics,

7
00:00:22.768 --> 00:00:26.225
and the catalog tasks, which
live in the I T S M tool.

8
00:00:26.225 --> 00:00:28.125
Two of the eight are partial.

9
00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:30.182
The grants tab lists grants,

10
00:00:30.182 --> 00:00:33.937
but matching each to a ticket
stays in the I T S M tool.

11
00:00:33.937 --> 00:00:36.279
And the log review tab shows the queue,

12
00:00:36.279 --> 00:00:39.580
while the review itself
stays a recorded procedure.
